{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>That you have ridden upon me.</b> Many times. Here the word pauses, for there is a revia on עלי." "<b>From your earliest days until this day.</b> It refers to הסכן הסכנתי — like a person who says to his fellow: 'Have I ever done thus to you?' That is to say: since I am not accustomed to this, you should have understood that I did not do thus to you for nothing."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:19.663043420Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}